  "_comment": "cc-switch, which the agent runs as each account to point the machine's AI tools at the gateway. It is no module: is_module is false, so it stays out of the catalog, and the agent opens package {module: cc_switch, artifact, digest} for it when its ai_tools section needs a copy. The version, each file and each digest are the client's pin, PACKAGING_CC_SWITCH_* in packaging/shared/constants.py, which a hub test holds this file to. Its sources are the publisher's GitHub release, then each release site the hub's build stamped, which holds the same files under their upstream names.",
